00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:00.010
But...!

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:01.500
That's why what?!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:03.650
A-Aniki...

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:10.000
What's this crap about leaving?

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.280
You traitor!

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:13.950
You can punch me all you want...

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:16.390
But I've already made up my mind!

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:18.290
And I'm saying that's too selfish of you!

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:23.040
I thought of you as if you were my little brother...

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:24.510
So why...?!

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:26.420
Even I...!

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:32.290
Even I want to stay with you forever, Aniki!

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:33.370
Then...!

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.800
Then why don't you just stay here?!

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.220
I <i>can't</i> !

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:39.810
The Gate is going to close.

00:15:40.470 --> 00:15:42.580
There won't be anymore Digimon incidents.

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.290
So what'll that make me?

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:48.340
I'll just be one big <i>nuisance</i>  who spends his entire time sleeping and getting fat on Sayuri's fried eggs!

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:49.480
Agumon...

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:53.450
I can't forget the days I fought together with you.

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.010
I...!

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:59.160
I want to keep having adventures with you, Aniki!

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:01.290
Well...!

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:02.720
Even I...!

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:04.690
Even I want to be with you!

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:07.630
I want to keep running wild with you everywhere until I die!!!

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:17.070
Go to the Digital World.

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:21.680
This world is too small for you.

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:24.520
Go back to the world you belong in.

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:26.560
Aniki...

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:46.820
I've made some tea.

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:47.540
Gaomon.

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:52.710
This is...

00:16:53.430 --> 00:16:55.400
It's an original blend.

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:58.180
I call it "Our Vow to Meet Again."

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:00.640
Gaomon...

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:03.100
My Master...!

00:17:04.820 --> 00:17:06.880
Is no one else but you.

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:07.600
Gaomon...

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:14.530
You're amazing, Lalamon.

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:17.070
Now it's your turn, Yoshino.

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:18.360
Come on, come on!

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:19.490
Oh, fine.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:26.410
Yoshino?!

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:33.480
Hey!

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:34.920
What are you doing?!

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:36.760
We're sorry!

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:36.760
We're sorry!

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:40.480
That sure surprised me!

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:42.700
I'll have to apologize to them later.

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:45.380
But... it made me feel a bit relieved.

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:47.390
Because you've become stronger.

00:17:47.390 --> 00:17:48.730
That's not true, Lalamon.

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:52.690
You're not the Yoshino who couldn't play the piano by herself anymore.

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:58.700
Even if I go back to the Digital World, I can keep singing the song you gave me.

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:01.030
Lalamon!

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:07.960
You're all set.

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:10.800
Thank you for everything, PawnChessmon.

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:13.100
I wish we had more time to hang out...

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:15.420
Then we could've gone to the hot springs, or karaoke...

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:17.880
How about we do that now?

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:19.400
Seriously?

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:20.300
Yeah!

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:21.590
The night is young!

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:23.290
Wait just a... Megumi?!

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:24.930
Hey, slow down!

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:25.150
Where are you going?

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:26.970
Just around the corner!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:36.190
You're here.

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:38.820
This place relaxes me the most.

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:40.680
Me too.

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:45.730
So even you can laugh.

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:54.150
Kamemon,

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:55.070
drink up!

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:55.610
Okay.

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:56.500
Thank you!

00:18:59.940 --> 00:19:01.710
What a beautiful moon.

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:02.630
It is!

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:05.510
But tonight is the last time we can see the moon like this.

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:07.970
Kamemon.

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:13.480
Sometimes the moon looks as if it's changed shape, but it really stays circular all the time.

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:15.990
Come back at any time.

00:19:15.990 --> 00:19:17.550
I'll always be waiting.

00:19:15.990 --> 00:19:17.550
{onkei: Please let the ossan live a looooong life D8}

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:17.900
Okay.

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:19.150
Gotsumon!

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:20.190
You drink, too!

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:20.860
Y-Yes, sir!

00:19:22.190 --> 00:19:24.980
A lot of things have happened to us.

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:26.870
Too many things.

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:30.830
Falcomon.

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:35.300
I'll go back to the Digital World, too.

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:38.300
I'll make a new Digital World together with everyone else!

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:42.430
You can't, Ikuto.

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:45.720
What about your mom and dad?

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:48.950
Your family was finally able to welcome you back home.

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:50.210
But I...

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:52.110
I'm family with Falcomon, too!

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:54.410
I don't want to say goodbye!

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:55.680
Ikuto...

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:06.310
Piyomon!

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:07.240
Chika.

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.910
I wonder what Masaru is doing.

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:11.410
He must not want to say goodbye.

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:13.280
Masaru...

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:15.370
Stupid Aniki.

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:17.690
Coordinate axes are set!

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:20.460
Cooling of transmission equipment on!

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:22.050
Bionic Condenser functioning!

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:24.510
Digital Harmonizer aligning!

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:26.970
Security opening!

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:31.350
WAIT JUST A MINUTE!

00:20:33.010 --> 00:20:33.730
Aniki!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.410
Aniki!

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:39.950
Like hell I'll ever say goodbye!

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:42.460
I'm going to the Digital World with you!

00:20:42.460 --> 00:20:43.720
Hold it!

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:46.820
Who knows when you can come back if you go now!

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:48.630
Who cares!

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:51.790
I'm gonna enjoy traveling throughout the Digital World no matter how long it takes!

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:53.110
Masaru!

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:53.890
Go!

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:54.670
Dear!

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:56.750
Go there and polish up your manliness!

00:20:57.180 --> 00:20:57.990
Yeah!

00:20:58.890 --> 00:20:59.920
Let's go, Agumon!

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:03.130
You and I will always be together!

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:04.350
Aniki!

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:08.250
<b>tsuredashite ageru kara</b>

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:08.250
<b>Because it'll take me away.</b>

